      "summary": "feature-loop.sh: lower the default memory cap from 4G to 3.5G",
      "body": "Proofs and model checks now run in the verification pipeline, so the loop's scope only holds the Claude session and inline builds. Measured in capped systemd scopes with swap off: cargo build --release peaks at 1.1G, cargo test at 1.7G (finishes under a 1.5G cap), sync.py check --full at 0.85G, and the full Box Office Gradle build at 1.9G (killed at 1.5G, finishes at 2G). With the Claude process on top, 3.5G leaves about 1 GB of headroom for the heaviest case. README updated to match; FEATURE_LOOP_MEMORY_MAX still overrides it.",
